{"id":47299,"date":"2025-12-17T06:16:55","date_gmt":"2025-12-17T05:16:55","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=47299"},"modified":"2026-10-17T23:26:38","modified_gmt":"2026-10-17T22:26:38","slug":"maratona-de-atenas","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-atenas\/","title":{"rendered":"43\u00aa Maratona de Atenas Aut\u00eantica 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">43\u00aa Maratona de Atenas Aut\u00eantica 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>43\u00aa Maratona de Atenas Aut\u00eantica 2026<\/strong> realiza-se nos dias <strong>7 e 8 de novembro de 2026<\/strong> em <strong>Atenas, Gr\u00e9cia<\/strong>, desafiando-te a correr no ber\u00e7o hist\u00f3rico do maratonismo mundial. Com partida da prova rainha \u00e0s <strong>08:30<\/strong> de domingo na vila hist\u00f3rica de <strong>Maratona<\/strong> e meta lend\u00e1ria no <strong>Est\u00e1dio Panatenaico (Kallimarmaro)<\/strong>, o evento re\u00fane cerca de 75.000 corredores distribu\u00eddos por dois dias de competi\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Ao alinhar nos <strong>42,195 km<\/strong> do percurso original de Fid\u00edpides e dos primeiros Jogos Ol\u00edmpicos da era moderna (1896), passas pelo <strong>T\u00famulo dos Maraton\u00f4macos<\/strong> (km 4 a 6), enfrentas a m\u00edtica subida cont\u00ednua entre <strong>Pikermi<\/strong>, <strong>Pallini<\/strong> e o n\u00f3 de <strong>Stavros<\/strong> (at\u00e9 ao km 31) e desces pela Avenida Messogeion at\u00e9 pisar o m\u00e1rmore branco do <strong>Est\u00e1dio Panatenaico<\/strong>. O programa inclui ainda os <strong>10 km<\/strong> (domingo \u00e0s 08:00) e as corridas de <strong>5 km<\/strong>, <strong>5 km Universities Night Run<\/strong> e <strong>1,2 km Kids Race<\/strong> no s\u00e1bado, com partidas na Avenida Vasilissis Amalias, junto \u00e0 <strong>Pra\u00e7a Syntagma<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pela <strong>SEGAS (Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Hel\u00e9nica de Atletismo)<\/strong> sob as normas da World Athletics e da AIMS, a prova assegura transporte oficial em autocarros diretos desde seis esta\u00e7\u00f5es de metro do centro de Atenas para a partida em Maratona (entre as 05:00 e as 06:45), tempo limite de <strong>8 horas<\/strong> e exposi\u00e7\u00e3o oficial <strong>Allwyn Marathon Expo<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">7 a 8 de Novembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Maratona (Partida 42K) \/ Est\u00e1dio Panatenaico, Atenas (Meta), Gr\u00e9cia<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; over