style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Advanced Level (Residentes UE):<\/strong> 40,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Esgotado)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Full Registration Level:<\/strong> 85,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Esgotado)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Noturna<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">5km Universities Night Run allwyn<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 7 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 20:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Advanced Level (Estudantes UE):<\/strong> 25,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Esgotado)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Full Registration Level:<\/strong> 45,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Esgotado)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Kids Race 1.200m Telekom<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 7 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 16:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Jovem (Nascidos 2015-2017):<\/strong> 0,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 limite de vagas)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as datas, hor\u00e1rios e locais de partida da 43\u00aa Maratona de Atenas Aut\u00eantica 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento decorre nos dias 7 e 8 de novembro de 2026. No s\u00e1bado (7 de novembro), partem da Avenida Vasilissis Amalias (Syntagma) a Kids Race 1,2 km (16:00), a Corrida de 5 km (17:00) e a 5 km Universities Night Run (20:00). No domingo (8 de novembro), a Corrida de 10 km parte \u00e0s 08:00 em Syntagma e a Maratona Aut\u00eantica (42,195 km) parte \u00e0s 08:30 na vila de Maratona. Todas as provas terminam no Est\u00e1dio Panatenaico.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona o transporte oficial de atletas para a partida em Maratona?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o assegura o transporte direto e gratuito em autocarros oficiais para os atletas da Maratona entre as 05:00 e as 06:45 da manh\u00e3 de domingo, com embarque junto a seis esta\u00e7\u00f5es de metro no centro de Atenas: Syntagma, Syngrou-Fix (\u00faltimo autocarro \u00e0s 06:15), Panepistimio, Evangelismos, Katechaki e Omonia.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como \u00e9 a altimetria do percurso aut\u00eantico de 42,195 km e qual o tempo limite?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os primeiros 10 km (com passagem pelo T\u00famulo de Maratona) s\u00e3o planos ou em ligeira descida; entre os km 11 e 31 (at\u00e9 ao n\u00f3 de Stavros) o tra\u00e7ado apresenta subidas prolongadas e exigentes, seguidas de 11 km finais em descida favor\u00e1vel at\u00e9 ao Est\u00e1dio Panatenaico. O tempo limite oficial \u00e9 de 8 horas (fecho da meta \u00e0s 18:15). Podes planear os teus parciais na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/tabela-paces-maratona\/\">Tabela de Paces de Maratona<\/a>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o estado das vagas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Para residentes na Uni\u00e3o Europeia (Advanced Level), as taxas oficiais s\u00e3o de 75,00 \u20ac na Maratona (165,00 \u20ac Full Level), 45,00 \u20ac nos 10 km (90,00 \u20ac Full Level), 40,00 \u20ac nos 5 km (85,00 \u20ac Full Level), 25,00 \u20ac na 5 km Universities Night Run e gratuita na Kids Race 1,2 km. As vagas para as provas principais encontram-se esgotadas (Sold Out).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza a prova e como funciona a recolha de agasalhos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 organizada pela SEGAS (Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Hel\u00e9nica de Atletismo). Os atletas da Maratona entregam o saco oficial de equipamento nos cami\u00f5es de guarda-roupa junto \u00e0 partida em Maratona at\u00e9 30 minutos antes do seu bloco e levantam os seus pertences na esplanada exterior do Est\u00e1dio Panatenaico ap\u00f3s cortar a meta.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"43\u00aa Maratona de Atenas Aut\u00eantica 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-07\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Maratona (Partida 42K) \/ Est\u00e1dio Panatenaico, Atenas (Meta)\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Atenas\", \"addressRegion\": \"Gr\u00e9cia\", \"addressCountry\": \"GR\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"SEGAS (Hellenic Athletics Federation)\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as datas, hor\u00e1rios e locais de partida da 43\u00aa Maratona de Atenas Aut\u00eantica 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento decorre nos dias 7 e 8 de novembro de 2026. No s\u00e1bado (7 de novembro), partem da Avenida Vasilissis Amalias (Syntagma) a Kids Race 1,2 km (16:00), a Corrida de 5 km (17:00) e a 5 km Universities Night Run (20:00). No domingo (8 de novembro), a Corrida de 10 km parte \u00e0s 08:00 em Syntagma e a Maratona Aut\u00eantica (42,195 km) parte \u00e0s 08:30 na vila de Maratona. Todas as provas terminam no Est\u00e1dio Panatenaico.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funciona o transporte oficial de atletas para a partida em Maratona?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o assegura o transporte direto e gratuito em autocarros oficiais para os atletas da Maratona entre as 05:00 e as 06:45 da manh\u00e3 de domingo, com embarque junto a seis esta\u00e7\u00f5es de metro no centro de Atenas: Syntagma, Syngrou-Fix (\u00faltimo autocarro \u00e0s 06:15), Panepistimio, Evangelismos, Katechaki e Omonia.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como \u00e9 a altimetria do percurso aut\u00eantico de 42,195 km e qual o tempo limite?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Os primeiros 10 km (com passagem pelo T\u00famulo de Maratona) s\u00e3o planos ou em ligeira descida; entre os km 11 e 31 (at\u00e9 ao n\u00f3 de Stavros) o tra\u00e7ado apresenta subidas prolongadas e exigentes, seguidas de 11 km finais em descida favor\u00e1vel at\u00e9 ao Est\u00e1dio Panatenaico. O tempo limite oficial \u00e9 de 8 horas (fecho da meta \u00e0s 18:15). Podes planear os teus parciais na nossa Tabela de Paces de Maratona .\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o estado das vagas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Para residentes na Uni\u00e3o Europeia (Advanced Level), as taxas oficiais s\u00e3o de 75,00 \u20ac na Maratona (165,00 \u20ac Full Level), 45,00 \u20ac nos 10 km (90,00 \u20ac Full Level), 40,00 \u20ac nos 5 km (85,00 \u20ac Full Level), 25,00 \u20ac na 5 km Universities Night Run e gratuita na Kids Race 1,2 km. As vagas para as provas principais encontram-se esgotadas (Sold Out).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quem organiza a prova e como funciona a recolha de agasalhos?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova \u00e9 organizada pela SEGAS (Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Hel\u00e9nica de Atletismo). Os atletas da Maratona entregam o saco oficial de equipamento nos cami\u00f5es de guarda-roupa junto \u00e0 partida em Maratona at\u00e9 30 minutos antes do seu bloco e levantam os seus pertences na esplanada exterior do Est\u00e1dio Panatenaico ap\u00f3s cortar a meta.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":70071,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,28,478,624,31],"event_type_2":[627,1472],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-47299","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-atenas-grecia","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type-kids","event_type-maratona","event_type_2-europa","event_type_2-grecia"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-maratona-de-atenas.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/47299","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=47299"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/47299\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":70072,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/47299\/revisions\/70072"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/70071"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=47299"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=47299"},{"taxonomy":"event_type","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ev